{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204210","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1120421001:0":{"text":"埃莉诺前辈，没想到泣祷仪式的主持者是你！","source_cn":"埃莉诺前辈，没想到泣祷仪式的主持者是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x854231D264E5C62A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120421002:0":{"text":"梅丽莎，伽利？还有你们的朋友……你们也来风蚀飞地了。","source_cn":"梅丽莎，伽利？还有你们的朋友……你们也来风蚀飞地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE8296A1246369E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120421003:0":{"text":"没想到我竟然能有幸亲眼目睹这么罕见的泣祷，之前我甚至没在文献中读到过当地蛮血还会有这种传统！","source_cn":"没想到我竟然能有幸亲眼目睹这么罕见的泣祷，之前我甚至没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02F5A99E215DD8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120421004:0":{"text":"流泪和悲伤，本是一种正常的情绪，但这里险恶的环境逼迫这里的蛮血封闭内心，披上坚硬的外壳。","source_cn":"流泪和悲伤，本是一种正常的情绪，但这里险恶的环境逼迫这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB47F1ABDCDB3FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120421005:1":{"text":"但他们内心都清楚，自己和亲人都不会永生，死亡终究会追上所有人。","source_cn":"但他们内心都清楚，自己和亲人都不会永生，死亡终究会追上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D6D8ECD4CA7C9E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120421006:1":{"text":"我在用我的方式告知他们，传统不应该只教会大家如何更强大，也需要柔软的慰藉……泣祷就是这柔软的一面，为逝者而流的眼泪并不可耻。","source_cn":"我在用我的方式告知他们，传统不应该只教会大家如何更强大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0635A33A72419F07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120421007:0":{"text":"埃莉诺前辈，你知道贾克松吗？他好像经常来参加泣祷仪式，这里有一封他的信……","source_cn":"埃莉诺前辈，你知道贾克松吗？他好像经常来参加泣祷仪式，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF21D3F03666807DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120421008:0":{"text":"我们得把这封信交给他的母亲！","source_cn":"我们得把这封信交给他的母亲！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x241F8B15514F7707","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120421009:0":{"text":"谢谢……你们已经交到她手上了。","source_cn":"谢谢……你们已经交到她手上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x188B683133630630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1120421009":{"text":"谢谢……你们已经交到她手上了。","source_cn":"谢谢……你们已经交到她手上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x188B683133630630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1